   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. Who repairs, and how?",
   "originalText": "1. Who repairs, and how?",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a12-text-12",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 200,
   "width": 943,
   "height": 64,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 95028,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1256748,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "FRR is local repair: whoever sent the packet, X repairs it with its own backup for (D, X–Y). So the\ndestinations are the rows of X’s results table whose primary link is X→Y, and \"how\" is that row’s\nsimplest method (ECMP → LFA → Remote LFA → TI-LFA).",
   "originalText": "FRR is local repair: whoever sent the packet, X repairs it with its own backup for (D, X–Y). So the\ndestinations are the rows of X’s results table whose primary link is X→Y, and \"how\" is that row’s\nsimplest method (ECMP → LFA → Remote LFA → TI-LFA).",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a12-text-13",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 274,
   "width": 298,
   "height": 24,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 102947,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1361477,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "2. Whose traffic crosses it?",
   "originalText": "2. Whose traffic crosses it?",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a12-text-14",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 308,
   "width": 972,
   "height": 43,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 110866,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1466206,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Router W ≠ D sends traffic to D over X→Y when some shortest path uses it (a tie counts as \"uses\", like\nB1):",
   "originalText": "Router W ≠ D sends traffic to D over X→Y when some shortest path uses it (a tie counts as \"uses\", like\nB1):",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a12-text-15",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 361,
   "width": 404,
   "height": 20,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 118785,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1570935,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "dist(W,X) + c(X→Y) + dist(Y,D) = dist(W,D)",
   "originalText": "dist(W,X) + c(X→Y) + dist(Y,D) = dist(W,D)",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a12-text-16",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 391,
   "width": 759,
   "height": 60,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 126704,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1675664,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "W = A, D = E, over S→E:   1 + 1 + 0 = 2 = dist(A,E)   ✓   A sends to E over S–E\nW = B, D = E, over S→E:   2 + 1 + 0 = 3 ≠ 2           ✗   B goes B→C→E\nW = A, D = C, over S→E:   1 + 1 + 1 = 3 ≠ 2           ✗   A goes A→B→C",
   "originalText": "W = A, D = E, over S→E:   1 + 1 + 0 = 2 = dist(A,E)   ✓   A sends to E over S–E\nW = B, D = E, over S→E:   2 + 1 + 0 = 3 ≠ 2           ✗   B goes B→C→E\nW = A, D = C, over S→E:   1 + 1 + 1 = 3 ≠ 2           ✗   A goes A→B→C",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a12-text-17",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 461,
   "width": 203,
   "height": 24,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 134623,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1780393,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Result for link S–E",
   "originalText": "Result for link S–E",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a12-text-18",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 495,
   "width": 634,
   "height": 160,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 142542,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1885122,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Direction  Destination  Repaired by        Traffic from\n---------  -----------  -----------------  ------------\nS→E        C            S: LFA A           S\n           E            S: Remote LFA, B   A, S\nE→S        A            E: LFA C           E\n           S            E: Remote LFA, B   C, E\n\neach way:  1 LFA, 1 Remote LFA, 3 flows (a flow = one (W, D) pair)",
   "originalText": "Direction  Destination  Repaired by        Traffic from\n---------  -----------  -----------------  ------------\nS→E        C            S: LFA A           S\n           E            S: Remote LFA, B   A, S\nE→S        A            E: LFA C           E\n           S            E: Remote LFA, B   C, E\n\neach way:  1 LFA, 1 Remote LFA, 3 flows (a flow = one (W, D) pair)",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a12-text-19",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 665,
   "width": 968,
   "height": 40,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 150461,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1989851,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Every W found in step 2 has a row in step 1: shortest sub-paths are shortest, so X’s own path to D starts on\nthis link. X itself is always listed.",
   "originalText": "Every W found in step 2 has a row in step 1: shortest sub-paths are shortest, so X’s own path to D starts on\nthis link. X itself is always listed.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
