   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Direction  Destination  Repaired by               Traffic from\n---------  -----------  ------------------------  -----------------------------------\nPE1→P1     P1           Remote LFA PE2 via P2     P2, P4, PE1  (P4-P2-PE1-P1 = 30 < 40)\n           P3           Remote LFA                P2, PE1\n           PE2          ECMP                      PE1\nP1→PE1     P2           LFA P2                    P1, P3\n           PE1          LFA P2                    P1, P3, PE2  (PE2’s two paths tie at 30)",
   "originalText": "Direction  Destination  Repaired by               Traffic from\n---------  -----------  ------------------------  -----------------------------------\nPE1→P1     P1           Remote LFA PE2 via P2     P2, P4, PE1  (P4-P2-PE1-P1 = 30 < 40)\n           P3           Remote LFA                P2, PE1\n           PE2          ECMP                      PE1\nP1→PE1     P2           LFA P2                    P1, P3\n           PE1          LFA P2                    P1, P3, PE2  (PE2’s two paths tie at 30)",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a12-text-49",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 18,
   "y": 992,
   "width": 1013,
   "height": 20,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 388031,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 5131721,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "P4 sends to P1 the long way round through PE1, because P4→P1 costs 40 while P4-P2-PE1-P1 costs 10 + 10 + 10 = 30.",
   "originalText": "P4 sends to P1 the long way round through PE1, because P4→P1 costs 40 while P4-P2-PE1-P1 costs 10 + 10 + 10 = 30.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
