   "versionNonce": 5969553,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The per-link view turns the results table around: for one link, which destinations need a repair, which router repairs them and how, and whose traffic is on it. A\nproperty test checks that the rows match each repairing router’s own rows and the \"uses the link\" test.",
   "originalText": "The per-link view turns the results table around: for one link, which destinations need a repair, which router repairs them and how, and whose traffic is on it. A\nproperty test checks that the rows match each repairing router’s own rows and the \"uses the link\" test.",
